{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:54:09+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:54:09+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Autoliv, Inc.","sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Auto Parts","country":"Sweden","city":"Stockholm","website":"https://www.autoliv.com","employees":56028,"summary":"Autoliv, Inc., through its subsidiaries, develops, manufactures, and supplies passive safety systems to the automotive industry in the Americas, Europe, China, and Asia. The company offers passive safety systems, such as modules and components for frontal-impact airbag protection systems, side-impact airbag protection systems, pedestrian protection systems, steering wheels, inflator technologies, battery cut-off switches, and seatbelts. It also develops and manufactures mobility safety solutions, including passive safety systems for commercial vehicles; and safety solutions for riders of motorcycles and bikes. The company primarily serves car manufacturers. Autoliv, Inc. was founded in 1953 and is based in Stockholm, Sweden.","exchange":"Stockholm","currency":"SEK","financial_currency":"USD","summary_fr":"Autoliv, Inc., à travers ses filiales, développe, fabrique et fournit des systèmes de sécurité passive à l'industrie automobile en Amérique, en Europe, en Chine et en Asie. La société propose des systèmes de sécurité passive, tels que des modules et des composants pour les systèmes de protection des coussins gonflables avant, les systèmes de protection des coussins gonflables latéraux, les systèmes de protection des piétons, les volants, les technologies de gonfleur, les interrupteurs de batterie et les ceintures de sécurité. Elle développe et fabrique également des solutions de sécurité pour la mobilité, notamment des systèmes de sécurité passive pour les véhicules utilitaires, ainsi que des solutions de sécurité pour les motocyclistes et les motocyclistes."},"valuation":{